{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"没在想\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他不再反复审问自己该不该渴望，心思终于能放到喜欢这个人上。\",\n      \"key\": \"审问自己\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他想尽情对对方好，也想被对方同样珍惜，想知道两人能不能一直亲近下去。\",\n      \"key\": \"同样珍惜\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"text\": \"对方没给他新的保证，他想要的回应仍没着落，眼前的亲近却让他暂时不为此难受。\",\n      \"key\": \"新的保证\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他想趁这会儿还高兴，多享受一会儿已经有的亲近，不急着算以后能不能如愿。\",\n      \"key\": \"多享受一会儿\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S09-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R51\", \"R52\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-1\", \"S12-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把承认渴望后的变化写成不再审问自己、能全心喜欢；再具体写出想付出、想被珍惜和盼两人继续亲近，避免重复说自己更想靠近。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R53\", \"R54\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-2\", \"S12-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并收窄\",\n      \"why\": \"把内在充足落到想尽情付出和眼前亲近带来的暂时安稳，保留愿望仍无着落却暂时不折磨他的状态，不再把情绪高涨写成真的再无所缺。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R55\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-2\", \"S12-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆开并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把具体愿望放在 S12-2，把没有新保证、回应仍无着落却暂时不受缺憾折磨放在 S12-3。删去所有心愿都得到抒发的总结，避免把强烈欢喜写成愿望已经满足。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R56\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留暂时不盘算未来、想让当下多持续一会儿的态度，改成享受已有的亲近、不急着算以后能否如愿，去掉幸福完整地停留的抽象说法。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "395ecdbb-357a-4e9c-a0cc-11c59501641b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T104028846669Z", "elapsed_seconds": 901.921, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T10:55:30.780873+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "138d07a82a06c49c2712c207dbd42f7b8088989dfbea7473b93a8ef9cf906192", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T104028846669Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proo